  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1777949439_3889043_043713ac1497ab8f75a5ad79da61980f.jpg",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">• About our brand and products:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Joseph Signature Line is a premium men’s grooming brand built by a professional barber. We specialize in high-quality beard care products including our best-selling double-sided beard pencil, beard balms, oils, and grooming tools designed to help men achieve a clean, full, and confident look at home or in the shop.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><br>• What makes us different:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Our products are created from real barber experience—not guesswork. We focus on solving common beard problems like patchiness, dryness, and uneven shaping. With a strong social media presence and proven results, our brand already connects with a large audience that trusts our recommendations.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><br>• How affiliates can earn:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Affiliates earn competitive commissions on every sale generated through their unique link or code. We also provide opportunities for bonuses, higher commission tiers, and potential long-term partnerships for top performers.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><br>• How to promote us:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Promote through TikTok, Instagram, YouTube, or any platform using grooming content, tutorials, transformations, or lifestyle posts. We encourage authentic content—before/afters, routines, and real results perform best.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><br>• Other information:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">We actively support our affiliates with content ideas, proven marketing angles, and exclusive discount codes to help you convert. Whether you’re a barber or content creator, this is a brand built to grow with you.</span></p></div></div>",
